---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { getFaqs } from '../lib/content.js';

const faqs = await getFaqs('process');
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Our Process — Archcell"
  description="From your first idea to a coordinated drawing collection: discover the Archcell design process."
  interior
>
  <section class="page-heading section-pad"><div class="page-kicker"><span class="eyebrow">HOW WE WORK</span><span>A SHARED JOURNEY</span></div><h1>From a thought.<br><em>To a place.</em></h1><div class="page-heading-bottom"><p>A considered process gives a good idea room to grow.<br>Here is how a project takes shape.</p><a href="/contact/" class="round-link"><span>Start the conversation</span><i>↗</i></a></div></section>
  <section class="process-layout section-pad"><div class="process-aside"><img src="/assets/hero-night.jpg" alt="Warm evening light in a stone and glass residence"><p>THE PROCESS IS AS PERSONAL AS THE RESULT.</p></div><div class="process-steps"><article class="process-step reveal"><span>01</span><div><p class="eyebrow">LISTEN</p><h2>First, your world.</h2><p>We begin with the people, the site and the possibilities. What do you need today? What might your home need to become?</p><small>THE FOCUS / Your brief, plot & priorities</small></div></article><article class="process-step reveal"><span>02</span><div><p class="eyebrow">EXPLORE</p><h2>Find the idea.</h2><p>Layouts, massing and early material ideas give your brief a form. We explore the relationship between rooms, daylight and outdoor space.</p><small>THE FOCUS / Concept layouts & design direction</small></div></article><article class="process-step reveal"><span>03</span><div><p class="eyebrow">REFINE</p><h2>Make it yours.</h2><p>The chosen direction develops through conversation. Elevations, interiors and materials become more precise as the whole design comes together.</p><small>THE FOCUS / Developed design & agreed details</small></div></article><article class="process-step reveal"><span>04</span><div><p class="eyebrow">COORDINATE</p><h2>Resolve the details.</h2><p>Plans, sections, systems and interior details are organised into the technical drawing set agreed for your project.</p><small>THE FOCUS / Coordinated working drawings</small></div></article><article class="process-step reveal"><span>05</span><div><p class="eyebrow">HAND OVER</p><h2>Ready for the next chapter.</h2><p>We bring the project information together and review the agreed deliverables. Construction-stage involvement is discussed as part of your project scope.</p><small>THE FOCUS / Drawing collection & next steps</small></div></article></div></section>
  <section class="faq-section section-pad"><div><p class="eyebrow">BEFORE WE BEGIN</p><h2>A little<br><em>clarity.</em></h2></div><div class="faq-list">{faqs.map((item) => <details><summary>{item.question}<span>+</span></summary><p>{item.answer}</p></details>)}</div></section>
</BaseLayout>
